```

### CSS (styles.css)
```css
body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

.tooltip {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    cursor: pointer;
}

#tooltip {
    position: absolute;
    background-color: #333;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 14px;
