});
```

This code sets up an Express server with a single POST route `/resume` to save resume data in MongoDB. It defines a Mongoose schema for the resume data, including fields for name, email, contact numbers, about, education, professional experience, and projects. It then creates a Mongoose model from the schema and uses that model to save the data received from the client.

