}
```

4. Implement CRUD operations: In your service or controller class, inject an instance of the repository interface using `@Autowired` or constructor injection. You can then use the repository methods to perform CRUD operations on the entity. Here are examples of the basic CRUD operations:

```java
@Autowired
private UserRepository userRepository;

